{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-34","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a number neither be one of those which are continually doubled from a dyad, nor have its half odd, it is both eventimes even and even-times odd.","book":9,"number":34,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.34","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.34/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":34,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","contentId":"euclid-9-34","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5203eac81db64f394fbc2f8ff9a51382004a7d624d5d0c1d7b65828ac5915cac","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-34.statement","euclid-9-34.construction.1","euclid-9-34.proof.1","euclid-9-34.proof.2","euclid-9-34.proof.3","euclid-9-34.proof.4","euclid-9-34.proof.5","euclid-9-34.proof.6","euclid-9-34.conclusion","euclid-9-34.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-34.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d32f523c6e4889ba0ba3bbf7b9872213753ceebfb364b9f8d244e311ea10878","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number neither be one of those which are continually doubled from a dyad, nor have its half odd, it is both eventimes even and even-times odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个数字既不是那些从一个阴道中不断翻倍的数字,也不是其一半的奇数,那么,它既偶数,也偶数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-34.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab3c3b66b991a61eeda0dff8e94afa2e5a2b26378ef5fd77c0a3dd7c2651a0d8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number A neither be one of those doubled from a dyad, nor have its half odd; I say that A is both even-times even and even-times odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A既不是那些从一个阴道翻倍的人,也不是其中的半个奇怪;我说A是偶数和偶数的奇数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-34.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29d19184361b939fef25c0d8eb07abe1e03aba4f312102ad7b7ed5b8c79f9cf5","citations":["euclid-7-def-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now that A is even-times even is manifest; for it has not its half odd. [[VII. Def. 8](/principles/euclid-7-def-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A是偶数,甚至也是明显的;因为它有一半并不奇怪。 [[VII. Def. 8](/principles/euclid-7-def-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-34.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3aa0206741b771c4cd7305ccaee934adfe430f008e48b0206be96f5de0a83676","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also even-times odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是偶数奇数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-34.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4a3902d713509e731c062649eb93f12f02ee24a34a0a1600df1aa07b21c6b81","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if we bisect A, then bisect its half, and do this continually, we shall come upon some odd number which will measure A according to an even number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果我们分两切A,那么分两切一半, 并且不断这样做, 我们将找到一个奇数, 以偶数计算,整除,A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-34.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3e93f9684ce6dac843f8d22981f789ae87ac4d892638c597b4e943a38256a3b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, we shall come upon a dyad, and A will be among those which are doubled from a dyad: which is contrary to the hypothesis."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不然,我们将遭遇一头牛,而A头牛将加倍地脱离一头牛,那确是违背真理的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-34.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3fe78a18578fa1fa219a8913ad844d79ea745c8280d07995a226b79ebecb439b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus A is even-times odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是偶数奇数"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-34.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e669f84d36d6d33ccd9bd0f24cea30c8ec0fc093c4ec2ac00a782c062b48fc2a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved even-times even."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,它甚至甚至平时。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-34.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"96a7a29e6b00539f5fd22bbc3981bbe561e51d5c80a290d6db4986938f4d27f2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A is both even-times even and even-times odd. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A是偶数和偶数的奇数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-34.source","contentId":"euclid-9-34","revisionId":"euclid-9-34@raw-5203eac81db64f39","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89d39046b126e916ed3f1d1607de627766f8d4d7bf735b6584847d8e2ad97936","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.34/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.34\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-34:euclid-7-def-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-34.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 8"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-34:euclid-7-def-8:explicit","id":"euclid-7-def-8","book":7,"number":8,"kind":"definition","title":"偶乘偶数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
